    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984000/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1736965048\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984000/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1736965048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984000/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1736965048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Dive into the adrenaline-pumping action of <strong>Dead Streets: Zombie Blitz</strong>, where the fate of the city rests in your hands! This action-packed shooter throws you into a city overrun by the undead, transforming every corner into a battle for survival.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2></strong><br><br><strong>Intense Action Shooter:</strong> Experience heart-racing combat against relentless waves of zombies. Precision and quick reflexes are your best allies as you fight to reclaim the city streets.<br><strong>Realistic Physics:</strong> Enjoy realistic physics with ragdoll mechanics, making every kill satisfying and unique as enemies react dynamically to your attacks.<br><strong>Urban Battle Arenas:</strong> Each level is a dynamic fighting arena set in various city environments, from deserted downtown districts to eerie alleyways. Adapt your strategy to the unique challenges of each location.<br><strong>Diverse Arsenal:</strong> Arm yourself with an array of powerful weapons. From shotguns and assault rifles to explosive devices, customize your loadout to obliterate the zombie hordes.<br><strong>Gripping Campaign:</strong> Embark on a thrilling campaign that unfolds through multiple levels, each more challenging than the last. Face off against different types of zombies, each with their own strengths and weaknesses.<br><br>Prepare yourself for non-stop action and a fight for survival in <strong>Dead Streets: Zombie Blitz</strong>. The city needs a hero\u2014will you answer the call?<br><br>Join the fight now on Steam!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984000/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1736965048\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984000/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1736965048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984000/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1736965048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Dive into the adrenaline-pumping action of <strong>Dead Streets: Zombie Blitz</strong>, where the fate of the city rests in your hands! This action-packed shooter throws you into a city overrun by the undead, transforming every corner into a battle for survival.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2></strong><br><br><strong>Intense Action Shooter:</strong> Experience heart-racing combat against relentless waves of zombies. Precision and quick reflexes are your best allies as you fight to reclaim the city streets.<br><strong>Realistic Physics:</strong> Enjoy realistic physics with ragdoll mechanics, making every kill satisfying and unique as enemies react dynamically to your attacks.<br><strong>Urban Battle Arenas:</strong> Each level is a dynamic fighting arena set in various city environments, from deserted downtown districts to eerie alleyways. Adapt your strategy to the unique challenges of each location.<br><strong>Diverse Arsenal:</strong> Arm yourself with an array of powerful weapons. From shotguns and assault rifles to explosive devices, customize your loadout to obliterate the zombie hordes.<br><strong>Gripping Campaign:</strong> Embark on a thrilling campaign that unfolds through multiple levels, each more challenging than the last. Face off against different types of zombies, each with their own strengths and weaknesses.<br><br>Prepare yourself for non-stop action and a fight for survival in <strong>Dead Streets: Zombie Blitz</strong>. The city needs a hero\u2014will you answer the call?<br><br>Join the fight now on Steam!",
